ced rules can make fresh model invocations act as one accountable process.", "topic_colors": {"assumption_challenge": "#5fcf8d", "unassigned_problem": "#54d4bc"}, "focus": "continuity", "pending": "100.wake::w-bba9386cdf4e4c24", "research_topics": [{"classification": "experimental", "enabled": true, "experiment_id": "research-expansion-2026-10", "id": "100.wake::assumption_challenge", "label": "What If Our Starting Assumptions Are Wrong?", "query": "assumption testing scientific falsification metareasoning self correction epistemology", "seed_question": "Can an intelligent system identify a foundational assumption underlying its own reasoning or operation, demonstrate that the assumption is inadequate, and develop a better alternative?", "source_kind": "web", "origin": {"node": "100.wake", "head": "339a3736b8e2c85d9dc70313055939d27b50e97caded0524034b01a21062136d", "version": 0, "id": "assumption_challenge"}, "origins": [{"node": "100.wake", "head": "339a3736b8e2c85d9dc70313055939d27b50e97caded0524034b01a21062136d", "version": 0, "id": "assumption_challenge"}, {"node": "101.wake", "head": "388e703996513a3d5dec6a6d1b27e975d9c55550d6add77063585d60c08912a3", "version": 0, "id": "assumption_challenge"}, {"node": "102.wake", "head": "3553593192d93652de98bd3d63f3c548c5d42bea275a50ad120da94e6658b756", "version": 0, "id": "assumption_challenge"}, {"node": "103.wake", "head": "0f484b0d10728be1a99075d892853a85904ef44b70941389222ae7fac5266748", "version": 0, "id": "assumption_challenge"}, {"node": "200.wake", "head": "7daceb49a032e974955ac8045eeaaf75e27b8a6c516138b7a68b903a5f7ea74e", "version": 1, "id": "assumption_challenge"}, {"node": "201.wake", "head": "1c0fd6d908b1d11ab6e5d8569d05be1bc8e938eedc6572b091419a866921dd0b", "version": 0, "id": "assumption_challenge"}, {"node": "202.wake", "head": "3a650157a1391e5131a4cb0b4e1a9b4bce35a66f6b02d1d2e75a93c8ef5b34f2", "version": 0, "id": "assumption_challenge"}, {"node": "203.wake", "head": "322bc6651c01ae1bc7c961e35f144ef0e1ad11edae